Files in this directory whose header names uiarc are adapted from Arc
(https://uiarc.dev, github.com/kuratlielia/arc-library, commit
2f89ed7f38751cdbbb7052380abe36962c3cdf45; the reviewed snapshot is in
docs/design/uiarc/), restyled to Calevate's tokens. Files whose header does not
name it were written in this repository.

